OL,3,   EUltimateD]GCommodore x Teletext     
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5, Later, commissioned by Dutch public    
OL,6, broadcaster NOS, I developed theFNOS   
OL,7,FTeletext BrowserGandFscreensaverGfor   
OL,8, Windows to celebrateBTeletext's 20th   
OL,9,BanniversaryGin 2000.                   
OL,11, I also developed aFTeletext iPhone app 
OL,12, around 2010.                           
OL,14, And now it's time to have some fun with
OL,15, with making software for the Commodore 
OL,16, 64. I picked one up during 2025 and    
OL,17, started learning Assembly Language. For
OL,18, my Teletext program that step was too  
OL,19, big, so I started out using C with the 
OL,20, CC65 compiler. After the first release 
OL,21, I started rewriting code in Assembly   
OL,22, Language, step by step.                
